# Page 3 – Glossary

| Term                    | Definition                                                                |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Sales                   | Total revenue generated from product sales.                               |
| Cost of Sales           | Direct cost incurred to produce or purchase the product sold.             |
| Quantity Sold           | Total number of product units sold.                                       |
| Unit Selling Price      | Average selling price per unit (Sales ÷ Quantity Sold).                   |
| Unit Cost Price         | Average cost per unit (Cost of Sales ÷ Quantity Sold).                    |
| Gross Profit            | Sales minus Cost of Sales.                                                |
| Gross Profit Margin (%) | Percentage of sales retained after deducting Cost of Sales.               |
| KPI                     | Key Performance Indicator used to measure business performance.           |
| Pricing Analysis        | Evaluation of selling price trends and their impact on sales performance. |
| Profitability Analysis  | Assessment of the product's ability to generate profit over time.         |
